<title>INDIA: India's ITC classic Threadneedle NAV on funds.</title>
<headline>India's ITC classic Threadneedle NAV on funds.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Classic Threadneedle AMC Limited said on Wednesday the Net Asset Value (NAV) as at end of July 9, 1997 is:</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>    Name of the fund     NAV</p>
<p>    ----------------     ---</p>
<p>    Top  200 fund	  13.15 rupees per unit</p>
<p>    High interest fund   10.41 rupees per unit</p>
<p>-</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22 265 9000</p>
</text>
